h3 2.1 Terminology
text "This specification refers to both HTML and XML attributes and IDL attributes, often in the same context. When it is not clear which is being referred to, they are referred to as  for HTML and XML attributes, and  for those defined on IDL interfaces. Similarly, the term \"properties\" is used for both JavaScript object properties and CSS properties. When these are ambiguous they are qualified as  and  respectively."
