text IDL attributes
text object properties
text CSS properties
text "Generally, when the specification states that a feature applies to  or , it also includes the other. When a feature specifically only applies to one of the two languages, it is called out by explicitly stating that it does not apply to the other format, as in \"for HTML, ... (this does not apply to XML)\"."
